TEXT 1696 64 Left 2 ;VDS clamp from electrical/hot-wand.sch\nES1J anode at Vds; cathode at Clamp\nSM15T150CA between Clamp and ground\nC_TVS represents TVS capacitance.
TEXT 32 -64 Left 3 ;Hot-Wand 13.56 MHz final RF stage - ES1J / SM15T150CA VDS clamp
TEXT 32 -16 Left 2 ;Circuit: electrical/hot-wand.sch. Buck = ideal DC Vcc; Q1 = M1; driver stage and current transformer omitted.
TEXT 544 64 Left 2 ;C9-C12 = 4 x 100n; C13-C18 = 6 x 100p\nC20-C26 = 6 x 47p + 100p; C27-C31 = 5 x 47p\nC19 and C32 are DNP. D4/TVS1 clamp branch included.
TEXT 1184 0 Left 2 ;STTC-147 at 13.56 MHz (current-transformer.md)\nTipState 1: Cold = 42.3 + j13 ohm\nTipState 2: Warm = 55 - j16 ohm\nTipState 3: Hot = 12 + j24 ohm\nTipState 4: Open = 1e12 ohm\nL/C calculated from reactance at Freq.
TEXT 32 496 Left 2 !.param Freq=13.56Meg Vgate=12 Duty=0.5 Tedge=2n
TEXT 32 528 Left 2 !.param Rchoke=0.1 Rcoil=0.03 Rcap=0.01
TEXT 32 560 Left 2 !.param R_tip=table(TipState,1,42.3,2,55,3,12,4,1e12)
TEXT 32 592 Left 2 !.param L_tip=table(TipState,1,13/(2*pi*Freq),2,1p,3,24/(2*pi*Freq),4,1p)
TEXT 32 624 Left 2 !.param C_tip=if(TipState==2,1/(2*pi*Freq*16),1p)
TEXT 32 672 Left 2 !.step param VCC list 15 20 25 30
TEXT 32 704 Left 2 !.step param TipState list 1 2 3 4
TEXT 32 752 Left 2 !.param Tstop=1m Tsettle=980u Tmax=200p
TEXT 32 784 Left 2 !.tran 0 {Tstop} 0 {Tmax} startup
TEXT 32 816 Left 2 !.options plotwinsize=0 numdgt=7 reltol=1e-4
TEXT 32 848 Left 2 !.temp 25
TEXT 832 496 Left 2 !.meas TRAN V_DS MAX V(Vds)
TEXT 832 528 Left 2 !.meas TRAN V_DS_LAST MAX V(Vds) FROM {Tsettle} TO {Tstop}
TEXT 832 560 Left 2 !.meas TRAN V_DS_PREV MAX V(Vds) FROM {Tsettle-20u} TO {Tsettle}
TEXT 832 672 Left 2 !.save V(Vds) V(Vgs) V(Clamp) I(D4) I(DTVS1)
TEXT 832 720 Left 2 ;V_DS = maximum over the full run, including the 20 us LTspice startup ramp.\nV_DS_LAST / V_DS_PREV compare the final two 20 us windows.\nNo tip is open at the PCB output; no cable transmission line is modeled.\nUnused Ctip is bypassed by 1u ohm; warm Ctip leakage is 1e12 ohm.\nLtip=1pH bypasses unused L; its series loss is 1u ohm.\nRchoke/Rcoil/Rcap are assumed losses, not measured RF values.
TEXT 32 928 Left 2 ;STP19NF20_EST is a datasheet-based approximation, NOT an ST vendor model.\nNominal targets: Vth=3V; Ron~0.11 ohm at Vgs=10V; Ciss~800p, Coss~165p, Crss~26p at Vds=25V.\nRg=2 ohm, Kp=7 and body-diode parameters are estimates. No avalanche or self-heating model.\nGate is ideal 0-12V with 2ns edges and 50% duty; the real resonant gate waveform is not reproduced.
TEXT 32 1040 Left 2 !.model STP19NF20_EST VDMOS(Vto=3 Kp=7 Rd=85m Rs=5m Rg=2 Rb=0.1 Cgs=774p Cgdmin=10p Cgdmax=550p A=0.43 Cjo=789p Vj=0.8 M=0.5 Is=10p N=1.3 Tt=65n)
TEXT 32 1104 Left 2 ;Same MOSFET/gate/network assumptions as rf_amp.asc. Only the drain clamp is added.\nDiodes are datasheet-based approximations, not vendor SPICE models; fixed at 25C, no self-heating or failure.\nThe TVS knee uses the upper 25C breakdown value, not a typical 150V device.
TEXT 32 1200 Left 2 !.param VbrTVS=158 Rtvs=6.81 Ctvs=200p TtES=15n
TEXT 32 1232 Left 2 !.model ES1J_EST D(Is=1n N=2 Rs=0.235 Cjo=42.4p Vj=0.7 M=0.4 Tt={TtES} Bv=600 Ibv=5u)
TEXT 32 1264 Left 2 !.model SM15T150CA_EST D(Ron={Rtvs} Rrev={Rtvs} Roff=1G Vfwd={VbrTVS} Vrev={VbrTVS} Epsilon=0.01 Revepsilon=0.01)
TEXT 32 1312 Left 2 ;TVS upper-voltage 10/1000us fit: V ~= 158 + 6.81*I, about 207V at 7.2A.\n200pF TVS capacitance is an assumed lumped value; leakage is approximated by 1G ohm.\nES1J fit: Vf~1.3V at 1A, Cj~20pF at 4V. Tt=15ns is an estimate, not its quoted 35ns trr.\nMicrosecond surge data and estimated diode models are not a validated 13.56MHz clamp model.
TEXT 1696 496 Left 2 !.meas TRAN I_TVS_PK MAX I(DTVS1)
TEXT 1696 528 Left 2 !.meas TRAN P_TVS AVG (V(Clamp)*I(DTVS1)) FROM {Tsettle} TO {Tstop}
TEXT 1696 560 Left 2 !.meas TRAN E_TVS INTEG (V(Clamp)*I(DTVS1))
TEXT 1696 592 Left 2 !.meas TRAN P_ES1J AVG (V(Vds,Clamp)*I(D4)) FROM {Tsettle} TO {Tstop}
TEXT 1696 624 Left 2 !.meas TRAN I_ES1J_PK MAX I(D4)
TEXT 1696 656 Left 2 !.meas TRAN P_TVS_PREV AVG (V(Clamp)*I(DTVS1)) FROM {Tsettle-20u} TO {Tsettle}
TEXT 1696 720 Left 2 ;P_TVS uses TVS conduction current only.\nC_TVS reactive current is excluded from TVS heat.\nES1J terminal power is averaged over final RF cycles.\nE_TVS covers the whole 1ms run.
